{
    "comment": "최근 본 상품 가로 줄. 다른 두 줄과 달리 목록의 출처가 서버가 아니라 **브라우저 localStorage 의 id 목록**\n     이라, 로그인하지 않아도 남고 기기를 옮기면 사라진다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "최근 본 상품 섹션"
    },
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "if": "{{recentProducts.data && recentProducts.data.length > 0}}",
    "isolatedState": {
        "scrollIdx": 0
    },
    "isolatedScopeId": "recent-products-scroll",
    "props": {
        "className": "mb-12"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "flex justify-between items-center mb-4"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "H2",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "clock",
                                "className": "text-xl"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "text": "$t:shop.recent_products"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "이전 — 자리를 옮긴 뒤 그 카드로 굴린다",
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "isolated",
                                                "scrollIdx": "{{_isolated.scrollIdx - 1}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "scrollIntoView",
                                            "params": {
                                                "selector": "#recent-product-{{_isolated.scrollIdx}}",
                                                "behavior": "smooth",
                                                "inline": "start",
                                                "waitForElement": true,
                                                "timeout": 1000
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "aria-label": "$t:common.prev",
                                "className": "{{_isolated.scrollIdx <= 0 ? 'p-2 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600 cursor-not-allowed' : 'p-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700'}}",
                                "disabled": "{{_isolated.scrollIdx <= 0}}"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "chevron-left",
                                        "className": "text-base"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Button",
                            "responsive": {
                                "0-639": {
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "{{(_isolated.scrollIdx + 2) >= (recentProducts.data.length) ? 'p-2 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600 cursor-not-allowed' : 'p-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700'}}",
                                        "disabled": "{{(_isolated.scrollIdx + 2) >= (recentProducts.data.length)}}"
                                    }
                                },
                                "640-1023": {
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "{{(_isolated.scrollIdx + 3) >= (recentProducts.data.length) ? 'p-2 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600 cursor-not-allowed' : 'p-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700'}}",
                                        "disabled": "{{(_isolated.scrollIdx + 3) >= (recentProducts.data.length)}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "다음 — 한 번에 몇 칸이 보이는지가 화면 폭마다 달라 버튼이 꺼지는 조건을 `responsive` 로 따로 잡는다",
                                    "type": "click",
                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "isolated",
                                                "scrollIdx": "{{_isolated.scrollIdx + 1}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "scrollIntoView",
                                            "params": {
                                                "selector": "#recent-product-{{_isolated.scrollIdx}}",
                                                "behavior": "smooth",
                                                "inline": "start",
                                                "waitForElement": true,
                                                "timeout": 1000
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "type": "button",
                                "aria-label": "$t:common.next",
                                "className": "{{(_isolated.scrollIdx + 4) >= (recentProducts.data.length) ? 'p-2 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600 cursor-not-allowed' : 'p-2 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700'}}",
                                "disabled": "{{(_isolated.scrollIdx + 4) >= (recentProducts.data.length)}}"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "chevron-right",
                                        "className": "text-base"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "grid grid-flow-col auto-cols-[calc(50%_-_8px)] sm:auto-cols-[calc(33.333%_-_11px)] lg:auto-cols-[calc(25%_-_12px)] gap-4 overflow-x-hidden"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "iteration": {
                        "source": "{{recentProducts.data ?? []}}",
                        "item_var": "product",
                        "index_var": "idx"
                    },
                    "props": {
                        "id": "recent-product-{{idx}}"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "composite",
                            "name": "ProductCard",
                            "props": {
                                "product": "{{product}}",
                                "shopBase": "{{_global.shopBase ?? '/shop'}}"
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
